cf-1008 open site-to-site-vpn-faq-tunnel-max-pps / site-to-site-vpn-faq-tunnel-max-throughput
  site-to-site-vpn-faq-tunnel-max-pps: Each Site-to-Site VPN connection has two tunnels, and a standard VPN tunnel supports up to 140,000 packets per second (the VPN FAQ states this value for each tunnel; the quotas page gives it for a standard tunnel).
  site-to-site-vpn-faq-tunnel-max-throughput: Each Site-to-Site VPN connection has two tunnels, and a standard VPN tunnel supports up to 1.25 Gbps (the VPN FAQ states this value for each tunnel; the quotas page gives it for a standard tunnel). For a connection to a virtual private gateway, aggregated throughput limits apply.
